WEBVTT

00:05:58.145 --> 00:06:01.524
This looks like a share of stock
that pays dividends.

00:06:02.566 --> 00:06:06.946
Except those dividends are live dividends.
They give birth to more dividends.

00:06:07.613 --> 00:06:12.118
So if I were to track the whale
over her lifetime

00:06:12.118 --> 00:06:14.745
and keep track of all these dividends

00:06:14.787 --> 00:06:16.038
into the future,

00:06:17.081 --> 00:06:20.543
and then multiply that
by the price of carbon,

00:06:20.584 --> 00:06:24.880
and discount that
all the way to the present,

00:06:24.922 --> 00:06:27.466
I can figure out
what is the present value,

00:06:27.508 --> 00:06:28.884
discounted present value,

00:06:28.926 --> 00:06:32.054
of the lifetime earnings
of a single whale.